{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさーーーんっ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Merry Christmas☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/12/26/2041392/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"街はどこを見てもクリスマスモードで\n見てるだけで元気になるー♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私のベッドの足元にクローゼットが\nあるんだけどふと寝る前に、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もしかしたらここを\n開けておいたらここから\nサンタさんが来るんじゃないかなぁ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っていう淡い淡〜い期待が\n頭をよぎってなんとなく\nクローゼットを開けたまま\n寝てみました(∩^ω^∩)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来たか来なかったかは\n聴かないでねヾ(-ω-*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて、イブイブの12/23は\n名古屋で握手会でした(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒かったのにたくさんの方が\n来てくれたおかげで\n私はかなり薄着をしてたけど\nずーーーっとハイテンションで\n握手デートさせてもらえました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃあ私服紹介いきまーす♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/12/26/2041392/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ニット:snidel\nショートパンツ:SPIGA\n靴:R&E"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回も肩が出てました☆笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"肩が出る服を選んでるんじゃなくて\n気づいたら肩が出る服を\n買ってる(OωO )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも薄手だけど黒タイツを\n履いてるとこは生駒ちゃんに\nエライ！と褒められました(。-ω-)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"続いて2，3，4，5部！\n4部分続けてサンタさんに\nなりました〜ヽ(｡･ω･｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/12/26/2041392/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まなサンタ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このサンタさん、なんと\n肩出てるんです（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーやスタッフさんに\nどっからそんなの見つけて来たの？！\nと若干飽きれながら言われましたが\n懲りない性格なのでこの格好のまま\n楽しく1日過ごしましたっ♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくれた方、クリスマス気分\n味わってもらえたかなぁ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この日は揃えたかのように\nみーんなサンタさんのコスプレを\nしていて楽屋が賑やかでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/12/26/2041392/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たんひめ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/12/26/2041392/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/12/26/2041392/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまい♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/12/26/2041392/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にゃんまい♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/12/26/2041392/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆりん♪2人とも肩出てた(OωO )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カチューシャが〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-